      "sentence_id": 5,
      "text": "In Re:- An application for anticipatory bail under Section 482 of the Code  Criminal Procedure read with Section 482 of Bhartiya Nagrik Suraksha Sanhi  in connection with Saktipur Police Station Case No. 243 of 2022 dated  26.12.2022 under Sections 498A/376 of the Indian Penal Code.\n And  In Re: XXX (Husband)\n Petitioner  Mr. Parthapratim Das  Mr. Monojit Chakraborti  For the Petitioner  Mr. Anindya Sundar Chatterjee  For the State  1.\nThe learned Counsel for the petitioner submits that the dispute has been amicably settled and the petitioner and his wife are leaving together peacefully and the present petitioner does not want to press this application.",
